---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<figure class="platform-operations">
  <figcaption>
    <Icon name="layers" />
    <strong>OuterForge</strong>
    <span>Shared application features</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="operations-body">
    <h3>Background jobs</h3>
    <div class="job">
      <div>
        <strong>Generate CoA</strong>
        <small>Test record QC-0264</small>
      </div>
      <span class="pill green">Completed</span>
    </div>
    <div class="job">
      <div>
        <strong>Send analysis request</strong>
        <small>Outgoing email linked to request</small>
      </div>
      <span class="pill green">Sent</span>
    </div>
    <div class="job">
      <div>
        <strong>Update stock quality</strong>
        <small>Produmex API unavailable</small>
      </div>
      <span class="pill amber">Retry needed</span>
    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>What can an operator do?</summary>
      <p>
        Open the job, inspect the failure and retry it. The QC decision remains
        recorded while the stock update is resolved.
      </p>
    </details>
    <div class="shared-features">
      <span>
        <Icon name="users" /> Roles control access
      </span>
      <span>
        <Icon name="document" /> Changes carry an audit trail
      </span>
      <span>
        <Icon name="mail" /> Emails stay with their records
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="operations-caption">Capability illustration · fictional records</p>
</figure>
<style>
  .platform-operations {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  figcaption {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: var(--feature-fill);
    color: var(--on-brand);
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  figcaption span {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin-left: 30px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--on-brand-muted);
  }
  .operations-body {
    padding: 24px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .job {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 15px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .job strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .job small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  details {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 15px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--focus);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  details p {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .shared-features {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .shared-features span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .shared-features :global(.icon) {
    color: var(--blue);
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
  }
  .operations-caption {
    background: var(--mist);
    padding: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .operations-body {
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .job {
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
